Z||000000||BJW||04-23-2001||10:09 PM||||I did it. <P>It is NOT worth the trouble.<P>It looked cool.<P>It worked. <P>It only dyno'd 15 more hp than STOCK!!!!<P>I have a bad picture of the setup before I trashed it and went back to a stock setup with a STAGE II chip replacement and 160 degree thermostat (to prevent detonation - runs cooler)<P>Don't try the dual thing . . . even a driver's side custom plenum would have questionable value . . .<P>DON'T DO IT!<P>B in Toronto||||reg||1
